"cues": [
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 3.2,
"end": 12.359,
"text": "Emma's full order: I need 2,000 of the 36 V 500 Wh battery packs from Voltway for the spring launch run."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 12.859,
"end": 16.621,
"text": "No codes at all, and sixteen tools on the shelf."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 17.178,
"end": 20.661,
"text": "Which does the model call, and in what order?"
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 21.411,
"end": 24.615,
"text": "On our harness, the model picks every next call."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 25.115,
"end": 30.129,
"text": "The first three go out at once: find_item, find_supplier, check_budget."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 30.629,
"end": 34.715,
"text": "The pack is BAT-500. The supplier, Voltway Cells."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 35.215,
"end": 39.662,
"text": "The spring launch run, PRD-07."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 40.412,
"end": 45.195,
"text": "Then the budget, and the policy: an order this size goes to Daniel."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 45.95,
"end": 49.664,
"text": "A second search, for a need-by date, finds nothing."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 50.164,
"end": 54.576,
"text": "Then the stock: 5,400 in Manchester."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 55.326,
"end": 62.698,
"text": "Here it slips: it previews the request with a date it made up, 1 February 2027."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 63.198,
"end": 64.951,
"text": "A preview saves nothing."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 65.508,
"end": 71.255,
"text": "It checks the UN 38.3 certificate, then asks Emma for the date."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 72.005,
"end": 74.419,
"text": "She says 9 November."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 74.919,
"end": 84.822,
"text": "A second preview, then her yes, and only then does the request go in: PR/2026/04417, waiting for Daniel."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 85.38,
"end": 86.866,
"text": "Eleven calls."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 87.616,
"end": 89.265,
"text": "Tools catch mistakes too."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 89.822,
"end": 93.757,
"text": "In an earlier run, both harnesses tried a direct order first."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 94.257,
"end": 102.801,
"text": "The tool refused: a direct order is limited to \u00a350,000; this one is \u00a3285,600."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 103.301,
"end": 107.956,
"text": "Its next step said: raise a purchase request. They did."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 108.706,
"end": 115.312,
"text": "Now the same three messages on Claude's harness: Claude Code, on our MCP server."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 115.962,
"end": 123.427,
"text": "Claude orders the calls itself: 8 calls, no policy search, and the same request at the end."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 124.177,
"end": 127.032,
"text": "In both, the model picks the next call."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 127.532,
"end": 131.92,
"text": "Around it, Claude's harness runs Anthropic's own prompt and loop."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 132.42,
"end": 150.509,
"text": "In ours, we set the model, the prompt, the tools Emma sees, a battery-safety check before every write, a 14-round limit, and a log of every token: 34,984, about 2.6 pence."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 151.259,
"end": 153.233,
"text": "Many tools, one request."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 153.883,
"end": 155.949,
"text": "The model chooses the next step."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 156.449,
"end": 159.107,
"text": "The harness decides what it can choose from."
}
]
}